💯.  It's almost as if we've learned nothing from the effects of social media on people. AIs that are indistinguishable from humans (with video/audio) should not be allowed, let alone celebrated. 

As Daniel Dennett wisely said back in 2023, "Companies using AI to generate fake people are committing an immoral act of vandalism, and should be held liable."  https://t.co/Hl3NhUdFzz.  

@MattWalshBlog points out a few - but only a few - of the harms to come.

